
*
!.gitignore

# --------------------------------------------------------------- the talk
# Source only. Everything pdflatex emits, and the build-time verification
# scripts, stay out.
!avl/
!avl/avl.tex
!avl/avltheme.sty
!avl/parts/
!avl/parts/*.tex
!avl/tikz/
!avl/tikz/*.tex

# ------------------------------------------------------------- the report
# Same rule: whatever `latexmk -pdf report.tex` needs as input, and nothing
# it produces. report.pdf, report.bbl and the .aux/.log family are all
# regenerated, so none of them is tracked.
!CSE_200_Report/
!CSE_200_Report/report.tex
!CSE_200_Report/reportstyle.sty
!CSE_200_Report/refs.bib

!CSE_200_Report/sections/
!CSE_200_Report/sections/*.tex

!CSE_200_Report/figures/
!CSE_200_Report/figures/*.tex

# Photographs the report \includegraphics. Both are freely licensed with
# attribution; the credits live in the caption of the portraits figure.
!CSE_200_Report/figures/img/
!CSE_200_Report/figures/img/*.jpg

# pgfplots reads these at build time, so the report does not compile without
# them. Generated, but a build input all the same.
!CSE_200_Report/data/
!CSE_200_Report/data/*.dat


!CSE_200_Report/data/*.py
CSE_200_Report/data/__pycache__/

